# Claude Code writes lots of runtime state here (sessions, history, credentials,
# caches, telemetry...). Ignore everything and allowlist real config only.
*
!.gitignore
!CLAUDE.md
!settings.json
!agents/
!agents/**
!commands/
!commands/**
!skills/
!skills/**
!statusline-command.sh
# auto-synced from claude.ai account, not user-authored
skills/synced/
